{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15112480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15112480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1511248001:0":{"text":"グレートアラクノス……想像通りのデカさだね。","source_cn":"巨蛛王……还真是庞然大物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBE9F5C22F1C235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511248002:0":{"text":"ね、姉ちゃん……本当に、あんなのに勝てるの？","source_cn":"那、那个……缇洛亚，你真的打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7244F4757C2F894E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511248003:0":{"text":"っていうか、勝てる人なんているの……？","source_cn":"不对。有人打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE411EA07175EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511248004:0":{"text":"いるわ。ネフィルよ。","source_cn":"那非曾经战胜过它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA8B6DCDA493514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511248005:0":{"text":"彼がヤクボルを抜けたときも、この方角へ向かったそうだから。","source_cn":"几年前他脱离雅库伯尔时，就是从这个方向离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF78000B24A9A979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511248006:0":{"text":"でも、あの人は神の恩恵をもらった勇士だよ！姉ちゃんはただの――いってぇ！","source_cn":"但那非是曾经得到过神明恩赐的勇士，缇洛亚就只是——哎哟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E17CDD8AF314F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511248007:0":{"text":"戦う前から弱気になってどうする！アイツを倒す段取りは、何度も頭の中で練ってきたさ。","source_cn":"喂，别还没开打就败人志气！我已经在心里演练过无数次该如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6628969B771F300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511248008:1":{"text":"この油が入った瓶を持って、東の空き地に撒いてきな。ウチが合図したら、火をつけるんだよ。","source_cn":"拿好这瓶树油，浇到东边的空地上，等我发出信号就用火点燃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5250720398F9C8CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"木の油","source_cn":"树油","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C3BFE7569AC136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511248009:0":{"text":"え？お、オイラがやるの？","source_cn":"谁？我、我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x753ECC1A0B1B2B46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511248010:1":{"text":"おバカ！口先だけで理想郷に行けると思ったら大間違いだよ！","source_cn":"笨蛋！你以为跋涉去理想乡只要动动嘴皮就可以？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D9441925EB1E83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511248011:1":{"text":"勇気をだしな！アンタには、これからもやることがたくさんあるんだからね！","source_cn":"鼓起勇气，你以后要干的事还多着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8BB539EF88B29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511248012:1":{"text":"さて、みんなもよく聞いて！グレートアラクノスが火に釣られて巣を出たら、巣穴の中に巨大なトゲの落とし穴を掘るんだ。踏めばすぐ落ちるような仕掛けをね。ヤクボルだった頃に学んだことを、存分に活かすんだよ！","source_cn":"第二步，其他人听好——拿出你们在雅库伯尔学到的本领，趁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7A153C5773D8C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511248013:1":{"text":"ウチは巣穴の卵を先に片付けておく。それが終わったら……奴を討つ。","source_cn":"我会先扫灭巢穴里的蜘蛛卵。然后……就是决战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25742C91F47B3829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1511248013":{"text":"ウチは巣穴の卵を先に片付けておく。それが終わったら……奴を討つ。","source_cn":"我会先扫灭巢穴里的蜘蛛卵。然后……就是决战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25742C91F47B3829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511248014:1":{"text":"気持ちだけありがたく受け取っておくよ。","source_cn":"多谢，好意我心领了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25D193060C259D75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"気持ちだけありがたく受け取っておくよ。","female":"気持ちだけありがたく受け取っておくよ。","variant_male_record_index":"190054","variant_female_record_index":"190055","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511248016:1":{"text":"あとはウチに任せて！","source_cn":"其余的，就尽管交给我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9335ABB5B914C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1511248017:1":{"text":"自信満々なティラヤを見て、他のみんなも彼女の計画に従うことにした。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC571434E16DCFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1511248018:1":{"text":"そして、すべての手はずが整った……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D9EA9097D1D908","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"僕も手伝うよ。","source_cn":"你一个人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7BF32A79D80524","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"僕も手伝うよ。","female":"私も手伝うわ。","variant_male_record_index":"79513","variant_female_record_index":"79514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511248015:1":{"text":"へへ、英雄サマにそう言われると、ますます勝てそうな気がしてきたよ。","source_cn":"嘿，能得到英雄夸奖，看来我干得确实不错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF50D097EA31E8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":